{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the wobbly boots of a <strong>Drunkonaut</strong> and throw down in chaotic, physics-driven battles! Whether you're brawling on the couch with friends or taking the fight online, expect unpredictable movement, absurd weapons, and mayhem-filled arenas where anything can happen.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wobbly Physics Combat</strong> \u2013 Punch, push, and flail your way to victory in a fighting system where precision is optional, but chaos is guaranteed!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603900/extras/fight_short.gif?t=1745048725\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Grab It Before They Do!</strong> \u2013 Rush to snag over-the-top weapons and send your friends flying before they do the same to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603900/extras/weapons.gif?t=1745048725\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dress to Impress</strong> \u2013 Customize your astronaut with hilarious outfits before launching into battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603900/extras/customization.gif?t=1745048725\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unpredictable Arenas</strong> \u2013 Stay on your toes as rocket attacks, dangerous environment hazards, and sudden surprises keep every fight fresh and hilarious.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603900/extras/explosions.gif?t=1745048725\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3603900?t=1745048725","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3603900?t=1745048725","capsul